  lines:
  - speaker: Friend
    text: "What? But you love gardening. It\u2019s always been so nice seeing you
      decorate for our gatherings."
    isFromPhone: 1
    timeStamp: 5
  - speaker: Amanda's Grandpa
    text: "I know, and I\u2019m still planning on flowers."
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 8
  - speaker: Amanda's Grandpa
    text: "It\u2019s just, the kids are all graduating, some of them are even leaving
      home, I feel like I should be making something more special for them."
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 17
  - speaker: Friend
    text: Well, have you thought of doing something with your flowers that would
      represent something to them?
    isFromPhone: 1
    timeStamp: 22
  - speaker: Friend
    text: "Maybe you can use the flowers to write out a message, like you did for
      the one New Year\u2019s party."
    isFromPhone: 1
    timeStamp: 27
  - speaker: Amanda's Grandpa
    text: "Of course I\u2019ve thought of it. That\u2019s what I\u2019ve planned,
      it\u2019s just\u2026 all more difficult now."
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 32
  - speaker: Amanda's Grandpa
    text: "My hands grow less steady with each year, my wrists ache at the sight
      of basic tasks, and it\u2019s already twice as hard getting used to doing everything
      in this wheelchair."
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 41
  - speaker: Amanda's Grandpa
    text: "I\u2019d still love to decorate for the party, it may just have to be
      a bit simpler than what I\u2019ve done before, is all."
    isFromPhone: 0
    timeStamp: 47
  - speaker: Friend
    text: "I see. Well hey, whatever you end up doing, we\u2019ll love it."
    isFromPhone: 1
    timeStamp: 52
  - speaker: Friend
    text: "Don\u2019t strain yourself too much, alright?"
    isFromPhone: 1
    timeStamp: 55
